{"id": "3281226", "name": "חישוב נגזרת בעזרת כלל השרשרת - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "simp0", "params": ["q"], "body": "ratsimp(trigsimp(q))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">כלל השרשרת לאורך מסלול במרחב</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f:\\mathbb{R}^3\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> פונקציה גזירה, ויהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> המסלול</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px 12px;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle w(t)=(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle x(t)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle y(t)={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle z(t)={{CT:2}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\">נגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(t)=f(w(t))=f(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\)</span>. נתבונן בזמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t_0={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px 12px; margin-top: 8px;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle P=w(t_0)={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=({{CT:5}},{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרת המסלול בנקודה</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את שלוש הנגזרות בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=t_0\\)</span>.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle x'({{CT:3}})=\\)[[input:ans2]] \\(\\displaystyle y'({{CT:3}})=\\)[[input:ans3]] \\(\\displaystyle z'({{CT:3}})=\\)[[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\">[[validation:ans2]]    [[validation:ans3]]    [[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">כלל השרשרת</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">לפי כלל השרשרת,</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle g'(t_0)=\\nabla f(P)\\cdot w'(t_0) =f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0) \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את הערך המבוקש.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle g'({{CT:3}})=\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b;\">אין צורך למצוא נוסחה מפורשת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span>; כל המידע הדרוש על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> בנקודה כבר נתון.</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נחשב תחילה את נגזרת המסלול בזמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t_0={{CT:3}}\\)</span>:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle w'({{CT:3}})= \\bigl(x'({{CT:3}}),y'({{CT:3}}),z'({{CT:3}})\\bigr) =({{CT:8}},{{CT:9}},{{CT:10}}) \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">מאחר ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P=w(t_0)={{CT:4}}\\)</span> ונתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\nabla f(P)=({{CT:5}},{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})\\)</span>, כלל השרשרת נותן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 12px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle g'(t_0)= f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0) \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נציב את הנתונים:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 0 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle g'({{CT:3}})={{CT:11}}={{CT:12}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 0.7, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> כלל השרשרת יושם נכון והתקבל הערך המבוקש של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'({{CT:3}})\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הערך הסופי אינו נכון. השתמשו ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g'(t_0)=f_x(P)x'(t_0)+f_y(P)y'(t_0)+f_z(P)z'(t_0)\\)</span> ובדקו את שלושת ערכי הנגזרות שחישבתם בסעיף הקודם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> חושב כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> אינו נכון. גזרו תחילה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(t)\\)</span> ורק לאחר מכן הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> חושב כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'({{CT:3}})\\)</span> אינו נכון. גזרו תחילה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(t)\\)</span> ורק לאחר מכן הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, 